{"id":"event_ce_01_02","cat":"event","group":{"id":"ev40008","label":"Collab 01 · Part 1"},"label":"Walking with the Unknown","stage":null,"prev":"event_ce_01_01","next":"event_ce_01_03_s","speakers":{"andersen":"Andersen","Self":"Commander","c_npc_2":"Aki Hayakawa","c_3":"Himeno","c_npc_1":"Denji","c_2":"Power","neon":"Neon","anis":"Anis","rapi":"Rapi","Narration":"Narration"},"icons":{"andersen":"si_c903_00_s","c_npc_2":"si_c804_00_s","c_3":"si_c802_00_s","c_npc_1":"si_c803_00_s","c_2":"si_c801_00_s","neon":"si_c011_00_s","anis":"si_c012_00_s","rapi":"si_c010_00_s","Narration":"si_c999_00_s"},"lines":[{"id":"event_ce_01_02_1","type":"Speech","speaker":"andersen","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce_01_02_1","text":"The Ark is in a state of pandemonium.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":"Office","bgArt":"office","image":null,"bgm":"bgm_story_fairytalesend_if","movie":null,"shown":["andersen"],"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce_01_02_2","type":"Speech","speaker":"andersen","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce_01_02_2","text":"The official story is that there are no humans left on the surface,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce_01_02_3","type":"Speech","speaker":"andersen","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce_01_02_3","text":"yet here we are discovering five of them all at once.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce_01_02_4","type":"Speech","speaker":"andersen","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce_01_02_4","text":"I'm sure this comes as no surprise, but there's no information on them in any of our databases.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce_01_02_5","type":"Self","speaker":"Self","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce_01_02_5","text":"Are you sure that they're human?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce_01_02_6","type":"Speech","speaker":"andersen","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce_01_02_6","text":"I can't say that I am.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce_01_02_7","type":"Speech","speaker":"andersen","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce_01_02_7","text":"They look and act like humans, but we're unable to do any internal scans to confirm.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce_01_02_8","type":"Speech","speaker":"andersen","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce_01_02_8","text":"When we do, all we get is a white screen like we did with the energy waves. They could well be an entirely new type of lifeform.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce_01_02_9","type":"Speech","speaker":"andersen","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce_01_02_9","text":"The other thing that's throwing us for a loop is their attire and their belongings.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce_01_02_10","type":"Speech","speaker":"andersen","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce_01_02_10","text":"Their composition and methods of production are unlike anything we've ever seen.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce_01_02_11","type":"Speech","speaker":"andersen","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce_01_02_11","text":"The level of deviation is so extreme that we can't even establish a baseline for reference.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce_01_02_12","type":"Speech","speaker":"andersen","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce_01_02_12","text":"That's how unique they are.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce_01_02_13","type":"Speech","speaker":"andersen","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce_01_02_13","text":"After some questioning, we find they're ignorant about even the most basic aspects of our society.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce_01_02_14","type":"Speech","speaker":"andersen","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce_01_02_14","text":"They apparently have never heard of Raptures, or the Ark.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce_01_02_15","type":"Speech","speaker":"andersen","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce_01_02_15","text":"What they do know, however, diverges wildly from our own knowledge base.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce_01_02_16","type":"Speech","speaker":"andersen","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce_01_02_16","text":"The modern society they talk about is vastly different from the modern society that we know.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce_01_02_17","type":"Speech","speaker":"andersen","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce_01_02_17","text":"Based on what we've gathered so far...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce_01_02_18","type":"Speech","speaker":"andersen","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce_01_02_18","text":"even though I realize how bad this sounds coming from a Deputy Commander's mouth,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce_01_02_19","type":"Speech","speaker":"andersen","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce_01_02_19","text":"I'm starting to wonder if we really are dealing with some kind of extraterrestrial beings.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce_01_02_20","type":"Self","speaker":"Self","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce_01_02_20","text":"Sounds like sci-fi gibberish to me.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce_01_02_21","type":"Speech","speaker":"andersen","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce_01_02_21","text":"You think I don't realize that?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce_01_02_22","type":"Speech","speaker":"andersen","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce_01_02_22","text":"Nevertheless, we cannot discount it as a possibility.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce_01_02_23","type":"Speech","speaker":"andersen","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce_01_02_23","text":"For now, let's see how things develop.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce_01_02_24","type":"Self","speaker":"Self","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce_01_02_24","text":"What do you mean?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce_01_02_25","type":"Speech","speaker":"andersen","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce_01_02_25","text":"You're the one who brought them back from the surface.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce_01_02_26","type":"Speech","speaker":"andersen","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce_01_02_26","text":"You'll be in charge of keeping an eye on them.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce_01_02_27","type":"Self","speaker":"Self","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce_01_02_27","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce_01_02_28","type":"Speech","speaker":"andersen","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce_01_02_28","text":"Fortunately, they've been extremely cooperative, which helps.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce_01_02_29","type":"Speech","speaker":"andersen","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce_01_02_29","text":"Take them out for a meal and try to pump them for more information.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce_01_02_30","type":"Self","speaker":"Self","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce_01_02_30","text":"Are you telling me I should take them out to dinner?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce_01_02_31","type":"Speech","speaker":"andersen","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce_01_02_31","text":"Yes.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce_01_02_32","type":"Speech","speaker":"andersen","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce_01_02_32","text":"Nothing builds rapport better than sharing a meal.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce_01_02_33","type":"Speech","speaker":"c_npc_2","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce_01_02_33","text":"Aki Hayakawa. I'm a Public Safety Devil Hunter attached to Special Division 4.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":"Restaurant","bgArt":"restaurant","image":null,"bgm":"bgm_inark","movie":null,"shown":["neon","anis","rapi","c_npc_2","c_3","c_npc_1","c_2"],"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce_01_02_34","type":"Speech","speaker":"c_3","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce_01_02_34","text":"Himeno. Same affiliation.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce_01_02_35","type":"Speech","speaker":"c_npc_1","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce_01_02_35","text":"Denji.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce_01_02_36","type":"Speech","speaker":"c_2","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce_01_02_36","text":"I am called Power! Kneel before me, human!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce_01_02_37","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce_01_02_37","text":"How far should I prostrate myself before you?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce_01_02_38","type":"Speech","speaker":"c_2","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce_01_02_38","text":"As low as you can!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce_01_02_39","type":"Speech","speaker":"c_npc_2","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce_01_02_39","text":"And you? What are your names?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce_01_02_40","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce_01_02_40","text":"Anis.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce_01_02_41","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce_01_02_41","text":"I'm Neon.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce_01_02_42","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce_01_02_42","text":"Rapi. Together, we form the Counters.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce_01_02_43","type":"Self","speaker":"Self","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce_01_02_43","text":"Commander {AccountData.NickName}.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce_01_02_44","type":"Speech","speaker":"c_npc_2","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce_01_02_44","text":"Commander? Does that mean you're the leader?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce_01_02_45","type":"Self","speaker":"Self","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce_01_02_45","text":"Correct.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce_01_02_46","type":"Speech","speaker":"c_npc_2","key":"Locale_SubScena