n a lab from all sorts of bits and pieces.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce_01_02_83","type":"Speech","speaker":"c_npc_2","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce_01_02_83","text":"... And it's safe to eat?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce_01_02_84","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce_01_02_84","text":"Sure it is... I think.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce_01_02_85","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce_01_02_85","text":"You guys seem to be really enjoying it, too.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce_01_02_86","type":"Speech","speaker":"c_2","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce_01_02_86","text":"Meat, meat, meat! Look at that pile of meat!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce_01_02_87","type":"Speech","speaker":"c_npc_1","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce_01_02_87","text":"Hey, hands off! There's plenty to go around!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce_01_02_88","type":"Speech","speaker":"c_2","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce_01_02_88","text":"This body of mine needs all the meat it can get.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce_01_02_89","type":"Self","speaker":"Self","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce_01_02_89","text":"You're certainly... full of energy.